{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"kofi-counts-the-market","version":1,"title":"Kofi Counts the Market","ageTiers":["5-6"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Kofi went to the market with Mama. The market was big and busy and bright. ‘Let us count,’ said Kofi.","sentences":["Kofi went to the market with Mama.","The market was big and busy and bright.","‘Let us count,’ said Kofi."],"image":"sha256:3a1f758696be32c24959100f2bde91312d836cedc29857861de0c3c0ed385105","alt":"A small boy holds his mother’s hand at the entrance to a colourful market.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:e6ddfad79af9a212a4cff7a482b05f215fd89a39685638939a6e12321d4521f3","durationMs":11987,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4180],[4180,8800],[8800,11987]],"words":[[0,440],[440,880],[880,1100],[1100,1430],[1430,2090],[2090,2530],[2530,4180],[4180,4510],[4510,5170],[5170,5500],[5500,5830],[5830,6160],[6160,6600],[6600,6930],[6930,8800],[8800,9130],[9130,9350],[9350,10450],[10450,10890],[10890,11987]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"One tomato, round and red. Kofi counted one.","sentences":["One tomato, round and red.","Kofi counted one."],"image":"sha256:939b9f26a9e2c82ae15de72b5cab0c1e106aaadcf10082306537507e7be2966b","alt":"One big red tomato sits alone on a cloth.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:4efbba84d5a681ca34890dc67ad78fca06a8d4e3ccfadd93661b349de7a560ff","durationMs":10403,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6687],[6687,10403]],"words":[[0,557],[557,2600],[2600,3529],[3529,4086],[4086,6687],[6687,7430],[7430,8730],[8730,10403]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Two onions, shiny and purple. Kofi counted one, two.","sentences":["Two onions, shiny and purple.","Kofi counted one, two."],"image":"sha256:cca0dfd1cf55df63a7dfe6991040b7d25a0ebe7a618d1b0b815ce620de2eb847","alt":"Two purple onions side by side on a cloth.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:acd9a8cc0319d12fec02cc20ca129b54b3d07fbd84b0b51e5f2dbe823fe13e80","durationMs":8123,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4729],[4729,8123]],"words":[[0,364],[364,1698],[1698,2304],[2304,2668],[2668,4729],[4729,5214],[5214,6063],[6063,7033],[7033,8123]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Three mangoes, yellow and sweet. Kofi counted one, two, three.","sentences":["Three mangoes, yellow and sweet.","Kofi counted one, two, three."],"image":"sha256:e458a569520dd1871b4fe18a85de7b4e69efa4ac6d395db2c8dcf91b8f91f39e","alt":"Three yellow mangoes in a row.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:6a5e10992f1048b155f485ff1d4847d32434cedd7623c8cbf2c3aef65c216340","durationMs":13115,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6886],[6886,13115]],"words":[[0,820],[820,2787],[2787,3771],[3771,4263],[4263,6886],[6886,7542],[7542,8690],[8690,10002],[10002,11314],[11314,13115]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Four bananas, curved and long. Kofi counted one, two, three, four.","sentences":["Four bananas, curved and long.","Kofi counted one, two, three, four."],"image":"sha256:d508fe689949b5afda995c7942c132c37dcffe713d1a230ee47dffe3495d6773","alt":"Four bananas lined up on a basket lid.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:d41c257537af069300ab7930ea57b9f8d8a38b3a23377144546948e99e1daceb","durationMs":12923,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5941],[5941,12923]],"words":[[0,594],[594,2376],[2376,3267],[3267,3713],[3713,5941],[5941,6535],[6535,7575],[7575,8763],[8763,9951],[9951,11436],[11436,12923]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Five oranges, round and juicy. Kofi counted one, two, three, four, five.","sentences":["Five oranges, round and juicy.","Kofi counted one, two, three, four, five."],"image":"sha256:6e48abf162626de05cdaaf3df8dc2463ab0cf1325457fb86bbf01a5e834f6d3f","alt":"Five oranges stacked in a small pyramid.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:045f7a391bbdf7a5ca4edc73956466b6689e3dd4878624ba3f0e1ec6bdd8da06","durationMs":14603,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6084],[6084,14603]],"words":[[0,608],[608,2433],[2433,3194],[3194,3650],[3650,6084],[6084,6692],[6692,7757],[7757,8974],[8974,10191],[10191,11712],[11712,13081],[13081,14603]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"Then Kofi saw a basket of eggs. ‘How many?’ he asked. Mama smiled. ‘Count them with me.’ They counted together: one, two, three, four, five, six.","sentences":["Then Kofi saw a basket of eggs.","‘How many?’ he asked.","Mama smiled.","‘Count them with me.’ They counted together: one, two, three, four, five, six."],"image":"sha256:357ded827abf1c720be558adfc89f039bce023dfda9499a8d7be41b780840458","alt":"Kofi and Mama counting six eggs in a basket together.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:05d19af7a539004cf0b9dd8d4445a4034eab361a0ef6477214c0f45d54d7399a","durationMs":22307,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4097],[4097,8194],[8194,10584],[10584,22307]],"words":[[0,455],[455,910],[910,1251],[1251,1479],[1479,2162],[2162,2390],[2390,4097],[4097,4438],[4438,6145],[6145,6373],[6373,8194],[8194,8649],[8649,10584],[10584,11153],[11153,11608],[11608,12063],[12063,13543],[13543,13998],[13998,14795],[14795,16275],[16275,17185],[17185,18095],[18095,19233],[19233,20257],[20257,21281],[21281,22307]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"At the end of the market, Kofi saw his friend Ama. She waved with one hand. Then she waved with two. ‘Hello, Kofi!’ she said.","sentences":["At the end of the market, Kofi saw his friend Ama.","She waved with one hand.","Then she waved with two.","‘Hello, Kofi!’ she said."],"image":"sha256:eb7fb811ffb9d8aaa95ff04bde3c23d34bbf742f236ba39732566d00dda532e8","alt":"A girl waves with one hand and then two to a smiling boy.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:3d90c01fa579e57f479aae3d2707ea4edb803c37d97fe675fcb06eea193141e6","durationMs":16187,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5748],[5748,8941],[8941,12135],[12135,16187]],"words":[[0,213],[213,532],[532,851],[851,1064],[1064,1383],[1383,2554],[2554,